    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000283",
    "title": "Morning and Evening Prayers for All Days of the Week",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Morning and Evening Prayers for All Days of the Week by Johann Habermann, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 25,
